Insurance Claims Analysis Dashboard

Project Overview

An interactive Power BI dashboard designed to analyze insurance claims, claim amounts, and fraud patterns.

Tools Used

- Microsoft Power BI
- Data visualization
- Interactive slicers and filters

Key Features

- Total claims and claim amount KPIs
- Monthly claims analysis
- Fraud and non-fraud claim distribution
- Analysis by policy type and customer demographics
- Interactive filters
- Business insights and conclusions

Objective

To explore insurance claims data, identify patterns, and present insights through interactive visualizations.

How to View

Download the ".pbix" file from this repository and open it using Microsoft Power BI Desktop.
